    "title": "Hack Check - Password Hacked & Generator Tool",
    "creator": "Matraex",
    "descriptionHtml": "Concerned about your email password being compromised, Facebook data being <b>hacked</b> &amp; personal information like phone numbers exposed online❓<br><br>If you are one of the <b>3.3 billion accounts</b> that were hacked online, which we know of, we can tell you. <br><br><b>Hack Check</b> app - can show you the passwords and display your Facebook data if it was part of the hack that exposed 300M+ Facebook accounts, with phone numbers, names, and more. We hear some of the main questions: was my Facebook or Fb account hacked or Is my Facebook account secure? Hack Check helps you find the hacked password details &amp; allows you to create a secure password through the password generator tool. The password generator tool will let you create strong passwords, difficult to hack, &amp; will thus secure your personal data from being hacked. <br><br>The app helps you connect with a guide to know what to do if your Facebook account was hacked, how to recover your account, &amp; how to secure it against insecure password hacks. <b>Hack Check</b> is not a hacking tool or hacking software. It is a secure app to find if your email or data was a part of the hack online.  <br><br><b>How it works:</b> <br>✔ Hack Check app uses multiple lists of data breaches &amp; cross-checks your email address to these databases. <br>✔ We use dark web Facebook data to look up your phone number, confirm your identity &amp; show data the hackers know about you.<br>✔ You can enter your email address &amp; see if any of your passwords show up as compromised. <br><br><b>Discover your compromised password in three simple steps</b><br>✔ Download Hack Check for free on your Android mobile<br>✔ Enter your email address, we send you a code to your email address to confirm that you own the account<br>✔ Once you enter the code we display any compromised password to you. <br><br>Other Hacking tools or Hacking Software require that you create an account on their service, which introduces yet another password &amp; service that can be breached, however, <b>Hack Check</b> uses a one-time security code method that will never allow your account to be breached. (Especially if you are like MANY others who seem to use the same password for MANY different online accounts) <br><br><b>Main Features</b><br>✔ Clean design with a fresh &amp; intuitive interface <br>✔ Password Viewer tool to check if your account has been hacked <br>✔ Free to use for multiple email address hack checks <br>✔ Password Generator for quick 40 characters secure password <br><br><b>Why use Hack Check?</b><br>✔ Was my email account or password compromised in past data breaches? Hack Check, the free anti-spy account security mobile app helps you to find out if your email account, password, or account has been hacked online.<br>✔ The app only has one single purpose so you will not get lost as you open the app &amp; check for your hacked account. <br>✔ Give this free tool a try to see if your email address has been compromised. You can even use this email checking tool to help check the vulnerability level of the email addresses of your family &amp; friends. By sending a verification code through their account. <br><br><b>FAQs</b>: <br>Often when people identify that their password was exposed in a breach, they have follow-up questions. When was my password hacked? We don&#39;t know where the passwords were found (on the Dark Web) there were no &#39;identifiers&#39; tracking the source. Is my Facebook / Google / Other account hacked? We don&#39;t know this, but if you are concerned about it, then you should change your password immediately. If the password that we found associated with your email is the same as the one you use anywhere else, then YES, your account is &#39;hacked&#39; - change your password immediately. <br><br>Download <b>Hack Check for free on your Android phone or tablet</b> &amp; let us know about any suggestions. An add-on question we often get: was my Instagram, Snapchat, Facebook, Twitter, or other account hacked? This tool allows you to check your account, &amp; if the password displayed matches the password you use on that site, then you can confirm it.",
